ask what you did differently You feel like a completely different person Right now, you can try it Completely risk-free for 90 days And it's up to 75% off So you won't wanna miss out It sells out often Don't wait\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/products/amua-vitaldrops\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":64027,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":576,\"duplicates\":2,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":1.72},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1425958442707868\",\"collationId\":\"1972695210071611\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-07T14:53:46.039Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-06T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/845f957dbcedf04bba98543e58852b1b224ee36e1d928ecad12b4f585f3382ed.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/2ed2e6eecbb379dda14791bffd2dffcf9586bdea219a41df25d967e12a5ebf79.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1120223791172422\",\"name\":\"Roseline William\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1120223791172422.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1120223791172422\",\"liveAdsCount\":565,\"reach30d\":295225,\"totalReach\":1104995,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1657,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feel confident in your body with a natural blend designed to support healthy weight gain in the right places!\",\"transcript\":\"I ran into my ex at daycare, drop off. Him and the thick girl he left me for. And the only reason I didn't fall apart was because of what my hairstylist gave me the month before. So let me start from the beginning. Me and Marcus were together for eight years, never married. He kept saying we don't need a piece of paper, and I believed him because I was in love. Thought loyalty meant the same thing to him that it meant to me. Two kids, my son is seven, my daughter just turned four. I gave that man my twenties, cooked clean, held him down through two layoffs. Drove his mama to church every Sunday, planned every birthday, every doctor visit while he needed space. How did he repay me? Started seeing some girl named Jasmine Dick Curvy everything I was and I found out through his sister's Instagram story. Then met brunches, hand on a hip, the hip I never had. He moved out two months later, said he needed something different. I knew what different meant. I was a skinny girl my whole life, straight up and down. Nothing to grab, the woman looked through to get to my friends. I kept on watching women feel different than me. At the mall and restaurants everywhere. Not pretending not to notice, but I noticed. After you left, I wasn't just heartbroken, I was exhausted. That deep she's been through it, tired. I stand in the mirror wearing his favorite dress, the one they used to make him smile, and it just hung off me like a curtain. No curves, no shake, no nothing. I tried everything. Weight gain shakes that made me bloated squats that gave me sore legs but nothing else. Those booty biting programs on YouTube. Protein powder that tasted like chalk. Nothing where it mattered. My stomach got soft but my hips stay flat. Then one day I'm in Keisha's chair. She been doing my hair for ten years. Knows everything about me and she stops mid blowout. Girl, what's going on with you? I almost cried right there. So to everything Mark as Jasmine feeling invisible my whole life, she looked at me then, looked at herself in the mirror. You know I wasn't always built like this. Right? Yeah. Keisha got hips, got curves. Got everything I wanted, I thought she was just blessed. She reached into a drawer and pulled out a small bottle. My cousin in Atlanta put me on this. Brazilian women been using these herbs for generations. It's not surgery, it's not gym. It's plants that tell your body where to put fat. I looked at her like she was crazy. Keisha, I'm not spending more money on something that's not gonna work. She looked at me dead in my eyes. If it doesn't work, I'll do your hair free next time. She's never offered free hair in ten years, so I took it home. The night after the kids went to bed, I read the bottle. Mock, mop, mop, guru, fenugreek ash, my jeans fit different. Second one, had to buy new leggings. Third month, tried on that dress. The one that used to hang off me like nothing. Couldn't zip the back, not weight gain. It just went somewhere new. Hips finally curving, booty finally sitting. Waist finally had something to gonna get step. I'm you to adjusting a waist trainer through a shirt, sucking it in, shifting it around under those fluorescent lights. Meanwhile, I just walked through that same light, but nothing but what those drops gave me. He texted that night, you're doing something different. I left him on red, but here's what you need to hear. The moment wasn't him looking at me. It wasn't Jasmine and Justin or Shapewear. The moment was me alone in that mirror the night before. Finally seen curves for the first time in my life. But once my body told the world, she's built like a boy. Then those drops changed where my fat went.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/pages/curves-quizv2\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":62177,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":560,\"duplicates\":3,\"reachDelta1d\":nu