k Here's what happens inside your body in the first 14 days After your first drop, phytostrogens go to work Supporting the signal that tells your body where to store fat After just a week, your jeans will be too tight And you'll realize you need to go shopping for new ones That's the signal kicking away, they used to go straight to your belly Starting to find its way to your booty instead After two weeks, the changes have compounded It's not in your belly, it's in your hips, your thighs, your booty right where you want it Your belly stay flat, because the signal your body's getting always in the store Fat in your stomach, signal, it's a curve signal After three weeks, homegirl's already on you Did you get a BBL? Nah, you catch yourself in the mirror and it's fucking real Your confidence shifts right along with it And after a month, your curves are sustainable, this isn't temporary When your estrogen stays balanced, all the fat goes in the right places Men notice you when you walk into a room Your ex suddenly finds a reason to text Your homegirls ask what you did differently You feel like a completely different person Right now, you can try it Completely risk-free for 90 days And it's up to 75% off So you won't wanna miss out It sells out often Don't wait\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/products/amua-vitaldrops\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":64027,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":576,\"duplicates\":2,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":1.72},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1425958442707868\",\"collationId\":\"1972695210071611\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-07T14:53:46.039Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-06T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/845f957dbcedf04bba98543e58852b1b224ee36e1d928ecad12b4f585f3382ed.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/2ed2e6eecbb379dda14791bffd2dffcf9586bdea219a41df25d967e12a5ebf79.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1120223791172422\",\"name\":\"Roseline William\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1120223791172422.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1120223791172422\",\"liveAdsCount\":565,\"reach30d\":295225,\"totalReach\":1104995,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":1657,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feel confident in your body with a natural blend designed to support healthy weight gain in the right places!\",\"transcript\":\"I ran into my ex at daycare, drop off. Him and the thick girl he left me for. And the only reason I didn't fall apart was because of what my hairstylist gave me the month before. So let me start from the beginning. Me and Marcus were together for eight years, never married. He kept saying we don't need a piece of paper, and I believed him because I was in love. Thought loyalty meant the same thing to him that it meant to me. Two kids, my son is seven, my daughter just turned four. I gave that man my twenties, cooked clean, held him down through two layoffs. Drove his mama to church every Sunday, planned every birthday, every doctor visit while he needed space. How did he repay me? Started seeing some girl named Jasmine Dick Curvy everything I was and I found out through his sister's Instagram story. Then met brunches, hand on a hip, the hip I never had. He moved out two months later, said he needed something different. I knew what different meant. I was a skinny girl my whole life, straight up and down. Nothing to grab, the woman looked through to get to my friends. I kept on watching women feel different than me. At the mall and restaurants everywhere. Not pretending not to notice, but I noticed. After you left, I wasn't just heartbroken, I was exhausted. That deep she's been through it, tired. I stand in the mirror wearing his favorite dress, the one they used to make him smile, and it just hung off me like a curtain. No curves, no shake, no nothing. I tried everything. Weight gain shakes that made me bloated squats that gave me sore legs but nothing else. Those booty biting programs on YouTube. Protein powder that tasted like chalk. Nothing where it mattered. My stomach got soft but my hips stay flat. Then one day I'm in Keisha's chair. She been doing my hair for ten years. Knows everything about me and she stops mid blowout. Girl, what's going on with you? I almost cried right there. So to everything Mark as Jasmine feeling invisible my whole life, she looked at me then, looked at herself in the mirror. You know I wasn't always built like this. Right? Yeah. Keisha got hips, got curves. Got everything I wanted, I thought she was just blessed. She reached into a drawer and pulled out a small bottle. My cousin in Atlanta put me on this. Brazilian women been using these herbs for generations. It's not surgery, it's not gym. It's plants that tell your body where to put fat. I looked at her like she was crazy. Keisha, I'm not spending more money on something that's not gonna work. She looked at me dead in my eyes. If it doesn't work, I'll do your hair free next time. She's never offered free hair in ten years, so I took it home. The night after the kids went to bed, I read the bottle. Mock, mop, mop, guru, fenugreek ash, my jeans fit different. Second one, had to buy new leggings. Third month, tried on that dress. The one that used to hang off me like nothing. Couldn't zip the back, not weight gain. It just went somewhere new. Hips finally curving, booty finally sitting. Waist finally had something to gonna get step. I'm you to adjusting a waist trainer through a shirt, sucking it in, shifting it around under those fluorescent lights. Meanwhile, I just walked through that same light, but nothing but what those drops gave me. He texted that night, you're doing something different. I left him on red, but here's what you need to hear. The moment wasn't him looking at me. It wasn't Jasmine and Justin or Shapewear. The moment was me alone in that mirror the night before. Finally seen curves for the first time in my life. But once my body told the world, she's built like a boy. Then those drops changed where my fat went.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/pages/curves-quizv2\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":62177,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":560,\"duplicates\":3,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":17,\"currentRank\":17,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":11.11},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_3980256198949602\",\"collationId\":\"1952979072043138\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-15T05:43:48.090Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-14T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-03T05:16:05.692Z\",\"daysRunning\":19,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/5e9d4c80866be58f5757975fba9a0a32bc049a35140d284adedb33c175713c6d.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/70a689586b76e0032ff76045cefa298eb71b701bca51b26199bba799072932e4.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1120223791172422\",\"name\":\"Roseline William\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1120223791172422.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1120223791172422\",\"liveAdsCount\":565,\"reach30d\":295225,\"totalReach\":1104995,\"countriesCount\":2,\"facebookLikes\":1657,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Feel confident in your body with a natural blend designed to support healthy weight gain in the right places!\",\"transcript\":\"My sister said I ruined her wedding day. No. I didn't sleep with her husband or do anything crazy. I just went from flat to curvy since we last saw each other. All because of what I learned on the phone with gonna to steal a spotlight as if I hadn't been jealous of her. Trying to gain weight my whole life. I tried every shake, every supplement, every squat challenge, giving it everything I got. But my doc said it was probably just my genetics or I could always get a BBL. So I called my aunt from Brazil. She's the one everybody in the family calls when something's really wrong. Right when I heard her voice, I just broke down into tears. I was tired of wasting my life away in a body I hated. Avoiding mirrors, not taking pictures, rarely getting a second look from anyone. Not hiding under baggy clothes even in the summer. She went quiet for a second and said, go to the cupboard on the hall. Take those little yellow droppers with the phytostrogens, and you won't have to worry at all. She said the women in Brazil with the curves everyone talks about and doing anything special with the diet. It's not about what you eat. Diet. It's about estrogen. Diet. The hormone that tells your body where to actually put weight, stress, genetics, years of it never firing right. All of that can throw it off, so your body just dumps everything in your belly instead of your hips, thighs, and booty. She said for generations. Oh, Brazilian women have used phytoestrogens, macaroon, fenugreek, ashwagandha to wake that signal back up and finally put the weight where it belongs. Once you fix that signal, everything finally falls into place. I trusted her. Took my first drop. Didn't feel much, but as the days went on, my appetite started gonna I got upset, but then she calmed down and grabbed my hand and said, how did you do it? I need to know I can't even be mad at you for stealing the show. I handed her a bottle of what my auntie told me to take. She texted me weeks later saying, girl, you are so right. I wish I knew about this before my wedding night. I filled out everywhere I wanted. My confidence, the way people look at me now, it's all different. I feel like a whole new person. It's not about trying harder. It's about giving your body the signal it needs. Brazilian women already figured this out. I ordered a few bottles for my sister and me because it's buy two get one free. And they even let you try it risk free with a ninety day\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/products/amua-vitaldrops\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":61410,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":553,\"duplicates\":3,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":1,\"currentRank\":1,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":0.68},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1117034347801450\",\"collationId\":\"1683738633314930\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-23T14:12:15.938Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-10-22T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-15T23:02:23.109Z\",\"daysRunning\":25,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.