796},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"BBL Before & After | Diva Sculpt Elevate™\\n\\nRefined curves. Enhanced contours. A shape that feels like you. \\n\\nEvery body has its own natural shape, and sometimes the goal is simply to enhance your curves and achieve a more balanced silhouette.\\n\\nTake a look at this before-and-after transformation, showcasing changes in the appearance of the thigh and hip contours.\\n\\nAt Diva Derm Clinic, our approach to body enhancement is centred around individual goals, careful assessment and realistic expectations.\\n\\n🤍 Why choose Diva Derm Clinic?\\n• Doctor-led consultations with Dr Maryam\\n• Personalised treatment planning\\n• Focus on balanced, natural-looking proportions\\n• Honest advice on suitability, risks and expected outcomes\\n\\nYour body. Your goals. Your journey.\\n\\n📍 Diva Derm Clinic, Harley Street, London\\n📞 07757 695631\\n\\nInterested in enhancing your curves?\\nContact us today to arrange your consultation and explore your options.\\n\\nIndividual results vary. Before-and-after images represent an individual outcome and are not a guarantee of results. Treatment suitability, risks and recovery will be discussed during consultation.\\n\\n#DivaDermClinic #BBLBeforeAndAfter #DivaSculptElevate #BodyContouring #BodyEnhancement HarleyStreet AestheticTreatments BodyConfidence\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"WHATSAPP MESSAGE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"api.whatsapp.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"api.whatsapp.com\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":9933,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":89,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":648,\"reachDelta7d\":6377,\"reachDelta30d\":9365},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":7,\"currentRank\":7,\"rankDelta\":2,\"improvementPct\":43.75},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"is