.\\n\\nReal weight gain isn’t just a number on the scale. It’s muscle. It’s glutes that actually grow. It’s skin that glows instead of looking drained. And it’s sustainable; so one bad week doesn’t send you back to square one.\\n\\nI’ve helped 300+ women fix this. Now it’s in one guide:\\n\\n✅ 14-Day Weight Gain Meal Plan (calorie-dense, easy to prep)\\n✅ 10 Weight Gain Smoothies\\n✅ Full grocery list breakdown\\n✅ Beginner workout plan (home OR gym)\\n✅ Nutrition approach that actually builds curves, not just bloats you\\n\\nAll for less than ₦10,000.\\n\\nComment the word ‘GUIDE’\\n\\n👉 Click the link in bio and start your glow up today.\\n.\\n.\\n.\\n.\\n#weightgaintips #weightgainjourney #gainingweight #weightgainprogress #weightgaintransformation\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SEE DETAILS\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://nestuge.com/glowupwg\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"nestuge.com\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":10,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GH\",\"NG\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":3,\"currentRank\":3,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":75},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1200776205412383\",\"collationId\":\"639818465840603\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-23T05:54:16.743Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2025-12-21T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-05-17T01:13:03.260Z\",\"daysRunning\":330,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6eae30ee081893698d429e6f97e84c833c45a3e53b841533a6921176f3bd95bf.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/304c95f97d6e295c3f3b023400fdf6e4e7cbe12b9d49e310ada1b6dd2a5c7885.